*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.otf binary
*.ttf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
*.mp4 binary
*.zip binary
*.whl binary
